# Unit tests for alarm.c. Expected outputs were written from the behaviour
# documented at the top of alarm.c, not copied from the implementation.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- limits / deadband
### limit-equal-is-not-out-of-range limits
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=600
init 0
s 0 30
s 1 10
s 2 30.001
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@2:30.001
